        <p>WY CL I F.F E CONGREGATIONAL CHURCH, BEWSEY-ST., WARRINGTON. FOREIGN MISSION ANNIVERSARY. TO-NIGHT: WELCOME TO DEPUTATION. 7.30. Chairman: Rev. C. P. PITT, B.A. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), NOV. 21st, 1915. 10.30 a.m.: Rev. W. J. HATCH (South India). 2.30 p.m.: ADDRESS to SCHOLARS in SUNDRY SCHOOL. 6.30 p.m.: Rev. A. J. HUTCHINSON (South China). Collections for London Missionary Society.</p>
