      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-11-20_WidnesExaminer_art0279" n="art0279">
        <p>HEALTH FROM THE PINE WOODS.</p>
        <p>The Great _Value of Peps for Coughs,</p>
        <p>Colds and Brofichilis.</p>
        <p>The lung-healing properties of pine-forest air are well known. In normal times invalids flock to home and foreign pine-forest resorts, get the breath of the pine-woods into their lungs, and gather new strength, comfort and healing. Nowadays, the increased cost and risk of travel abroad make this impossible. But there is a .welcome and effective alternative available for everybody. By the aid of science, - the curative breath of the pinewoods has been brought to our homes in the form- of pleasant tablets called Peps. The secret of the true medicinal pine balsams has been discovered, and concentrated in these Peps tablets, from which the medicine is re- leased in the form of air as the tablet dissolves in the mouth. •</p>
        <p>Thus the pure pine essences mix with the air we breathe, transforming it,' .as it were, into pine-forest air, laden with the same chest- strengthening virtues, in a highly, concentrated form.</p>
        <p>Peps are said to virtually bring a pine-forest to every home. If you suffer flint' coughs, colds, bronchitis, asthma, or any throat, lung; or chest ailments, you will find Peps just the safe, sound, mid rational remedy you need. But be sure that no worthless substitutes are foisted upon you. Peps alone. are your safeguard in the " bad cold" season. The- are sold by all chemists and drug stores at 1/1 plus lidh war- tax for the ordinary .ize box, and 2/9 plus 3d. war-tax for the larger size.</p>
