        <p>TEAMS FOR TO-DAY.</p>
        <p>RYLANDS'S RECS. v. ST. JAMES'.</p>
        <p>Rylands's: T. Archer; Thomas, Molyneux, Swanton and Hill; Sloane and Littlewood; Sutton, Barker, Lee, Latimer, Savoury and Butler. Reserves.—Mulvey and McCoy.</p>
