        <p>KILLED. PRIVATE G. ROUGHLEY. Not A Prisoner, But killed In Action. The British Red Cross Society, London, have notified Mrs. Roughley, 33, Golborne-street, who has been in a state of great, uncertainty and ,anziety as to her son. Private Gilbert Roughley, that he has been killed in action. Writing on Tuesday; an official of the society said : " Dear Madam,—We deeply regret to have to -inform you that, accordinglip a German list, dated October 23rd, and received by us through</p>
